# T11i: a stalled main loop must not corrupt the followed tempo. midiclock queues 64 ticks with
# their true arrival stamps, `stall` runs 20 ms of a busy main loop (audio keeps rendering, no
# MIDI poll), then the drain reads the stored stamps: the tempo is still 120.
wait 300
midi FA 00 00
wait 20
expect playing 1
midiclock 120 64
stall 20
wait 40
expect bpm 120
expect ext 1
dump midi_stall.json
